<title>POLAND: Tonsil Q4 net rises to PLN 0.2 mln.</title>
<headline>Tonsil Q4 net rises to PLN 0.2 mln.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tonsil SA results for the fourth quarter ending December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>						Q4 1996     Q4 1995</p>
<p>    operating				0.31   vs    2.24</p>
